     "type": "reading",
     "star": true,
     "title": "Make Your Own Scrapbook",
     "paragraphs": [
      "What you need: two pieces of thick cardboard for the covers, lots of sheets of paper of the same size, a hole punch, some ribbon or string, and some glue.",
      "What you do: First, punch two holes in each cover. Then punch holes in the paper in the same places. Next, put the paper between the two covers. Pull the ribbon through the holes and tie a bow. After that, glue your pictures and photos onto the pages. Finally, write a title on the front cover."
     ]
    }
   ],
